## **dygraphs**

:::: {.columns}
::: {.column width="45%"}

- Built for indexed time series
- Zoom and hover work immediately
- Good for sensor and monitoring data

```r
library(dygraphs)

dygraph(nhtemp) |>
  dyRangeSelector()
```

