## Plotly: Scatterplot

:::: {.columns}
::: {.column width="50%"}

```r
library(plotly)
plot_ly(
  data = iris, 
  x = ~Sepal.Length, 
  y = ~Sepal.Width,
  color = ~Species, 
  type = "scatter", 
  mode = "markers"
)
