## Plotly: Grouped bars

:::: {.columns}
::: {.column width="55%"}

- Use `add_trace()` to add a series to an existing chart.
- Set `barmode = "group"` to compare categories side by side.

```r
library(plotly)
quarterly_orders <- data.frame(
  quarter = c("Q1", "Q2", "Q3", "Q4"),
  online = c(28, 42, 36, 52),
  retail = c(35, 31, 48, 44)
)
plot_ly(
  quarterly_orders,
  x = ~quarter,
  y = ~online,
  type = "bar",
  name = "Online"
) |>
  add_trace(
    y = ~retail,
    name = "Retail"
) |>
  layout(
    barmode = "group"
  )
```

