## Highcharter: Stacked columns

:::: {.columns}
::: {.column width="50%"}

```r
library(highcharter)
weekly_orders <- data.frame(
  week = paste("Week", 1:4),
  new = c(12, 17, 15, 20),
  returning = c(28, 31, 33, 30)
)
highchart() |>
  hc_add_series(
    weekly_orders$new, 
    type = "column", 
    name = "New"
  ) |>
  hc_add_series(
    weekly_orders$returning, 
    type = "column", 
    name = "Returning"
  ) |>
  hc_xAxis(categories = weekly_orders$week) |>
  hc_plotOptions(
    column = list(stacking = "normal")
  )
```

